@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam defaultFontColor #1e293b
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam arrowColor #3b82f6
skinparam arrowThickness 2
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #f1f5f9
skinparam activityBorderColor #3b82f6

title <font size=16><b>Widevine CDM 4.10.2934 密钥生命周期</b></font>

start

:License Response (1210B)\n到达 UpdateSession();

:CDM 内部解密 license;

#fefce8:Content Key **K** (16B)\n短暂存在于栈帧中;

:立即 XOR 混淆\nK_blinded = K XOR M\n(M = session-derived mask);

#f1f5f9:堆存储: **K_blinded**\n(17 个 key_id 索引位置);

:--- 每次 Decrypt() 调用 ---;

#fefce8:栈上恢复: K = K_blinded XOR M\n(仅在当前栈帧内);

:白盒 AES 轮运算\n(OLLVM 虚拟化, 97% CPU);

#fecaca:K 和轮密钥 **清零**\n(函数返回前);

#dcfce7:**DecryptAndDecodeFrame 输出**\n解密后的 YUV 明文\n<- 笔者在此处捕获;

stop

@enduml